  "name": "Interception",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>(Prerequisite: Fighting Style Feature)</em></p><p>When a creature you can see hits another creature within 5 feet of you with an attack roll, you can take a Reaction to reduce the damage dealt to the target by 1d10 plus your Proficiency Bonus. You must be holding a Shield or a Simple or Martial weapon to use this Reaction.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-bOebMMgCjlpqzRnG\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The <strong>Intercept</strong> activity can be used to heal the correct amount of damage.</p></section>",
